& [ArtifactExistenceAndRoleGate] passes
  + source_document exists separately and remains byte exact
  + exploded_specification exists separately and is not the canonical file
  + semantic refinement, data design, constraints, pruning, growth seeds, and seven-fold trace exist separately
  + justification contains claim, support, confidence, counterargument, answer, and invalidation records
  + registry links source, exploded, canonical, signature, and phase lock roles
  + requirement matrix maps SMTC-001 through SMTC-030
  + canonical signature names source_specification, exploded_specification, canonical_source_specification, processed stages, exhaustion, registry, and phase lock
  + no stage is asserted solely by a label in the canonical file

& [FoldReapplication] passes all seven folds
  + fold 1 locks multi-target semantic programming as the subject rather than AI-only compilation
  + fold 2 locks roles, stages, authority, and exact-neural boundaries
  + fold 3 locks source, semantic, projection, proof, and runtime data planes
  + fold 4 locks hard versus deferred constraints
  + fold 5 locks logical compiler, target, runtime, diagnostic, compatibility, and conformance interfaces
  + fold 6 locks counterarguments, rejected alternatives, and failure cases
  + fold 7 locks the purpose plateau and defers physical profiles and implementation
  + [exhaustion_state] is phase_locked_for_bounded_language_purpose_only

